TITLE Pyrite oxidation in pure water, fixed O2(g)
SOLUTION 1 Pure water pH 7
    temp 25
    pH 7 charge
    units mol/kgw
    -water 1
EQUILIBRIUM_PHASES 1
    O2(g)   -0.7  10
    Pyrite  0    0.1
    Goethite 0   0
    Gypsum   0   0
SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file selected.csv
    -reset false
    -pH true
    -molalities H+
END
